OL,3,GNEWSA'Nigella could do no wrong' says
OL,4,ABake Off's Gabe
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore drag performer Gabe walked into
OL,7,Fthe famed Great British Bake Off tent
OL,8,Fthey had planned to treat the show as
OL,9,F"any other gig".
OL,11,FBut when it actually happened, it felt
OL,12,F"nuts", they said, especially when new
OL,13,Fjudge and "icon" Nigella Lawson
OL,14,Farrived.
OL,16,F"She's so amazing," they said. "I'm in
OL,17,Fthe school of, Nigella could do no
OL,18,Fwrong."
