OL,3,GNEWSA'Nigella could do no wrong' says
OL,4,ABake Off's Gabe
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginally from Grimsby, Gabe has lived
OL,7,Fin Birmingham for the past 15 years and
OL,8,Fis one of three Brummies on the Channel
OL,9,F4 show, including fellow contestant,
OL,10,FMo, and presenter, Alison Hammond.
